  '3d-2n-yogyakarta-classic-tour', '3D/2N - Yogyakarta Classic Tour', 'Indonesia', 'Southeast Asia', 
  'Explore 3D/2N - Yogyakarta Classic Tour with daily itineraries, local guides, and highlights', '/images/indonesia/9-600x400.webp', 'Experience the beauty of Indonesia with our special package: 3D/2N - Yogyakarta Classic Tour. Discover rich culture, stunning scenery, and unforgettable experiences on this day-by-day guided tour.', 
