  'After breakfast, your will be checkout from hotel and transfers to the airport to board your next flight for Boracay. On arrival in Boracay, you will be welcomed by your representative and transferred to your hotel. The rest of the day is at leisure to discover this charming island. Over Night stay at Boracay.', '["After breakfast, your will be checkout from hotel and transfers to the airport to board your next flight for Boracay","On arrival in Boracay, you will be welcomed by your representative and transferred to your hotel","The rest of the day is at leisure to discover this charming island"]', '/images/philippines/pack-7.jpg', 1
