  'Breakfast at the Hotel Check out the Hotel/ Transfer to the Domestic Airport. Fly to Boracay. Check in to the hotel. Overnight stay at Boracay', '["Breakfast at the Hotel Check out the Hotel/ Transfer to the Domestic Airport","Fly to Boracay","Check in to the hotel"]', '/images/philippines/pack-7.jpg', 2
);
