  147, 4, 'BORACAY SUNSET CRUISE', 'Boracay', 
  'Breakfast at hotel. Morning free. Later Pick up from Hotel & proceed for Boracay Sunset Cruise -meet up time 03.30 PM Shared in Local Boat Live music (Acoustic Singer) Back massage on board Amazing sunset viewing Back to hotel at Boracay', '["Breakfast at hotel","Morning free","Later Pick up from Hotel & proceed for Boracay Sunset Cruise -meet up time 03.30 PM Shared in Local Boat Live music (Acoustic Singer) Back massage on board Amazing sunset viewing Back to hotel at Boracay"]', '/images/philippines/pack-7.jpg', 3
