  'Early morning (05:00 am ) proceed to Oslob Whale shark watching & Kawasan Waterfalls with Turquoise water . 09:00 am Oslob Whale Shark Watching ( hotel will provide packed breakfast) 02:00 pm Kawasan Falls view ( Bamboo ride watching falls) 06:30 PM back to hotel & relax .', '["Early morning (05:00 am ) proceed to Oslob Whale shark watching & Kawasan Waterfalls with Turquoise water","09:00 am Oslob Whale Shark Watching ( hotel will provide packed breakfast) 02:00 pm Kawasan Falls view ( Bamboo ride watching falls) 06:30 PM back to hotel & relax "]', '/images/philippines/pack-8.jpg', 4
