  180, 10, 'Osaka - Osaka tour ~Osaka Castle, Umeda sky Observatory, Dotonbori/ Shinsaibashi', 'Osaka, Kansai', 
  'Breakfast at HotelPick up from Hotel @0930 HrsOsaka Castle - the most famous landmarks in JapanUmeda Sky Building Floating Garden Observatory (main observation deck)Lunch At Local Indian RestaurantDotonbori District - hotspot for tourists. Filled with towering neon signs, clubs, bars & restaurantsClick a picture with the iconic Glico Man, shot from under Ebisubashi bridge, a famous picture pointDinner at local Indian restaurantOvernight Stay in Osaka', '["Breakfast at HotelPick up from Hotel @0930 HrsOsaka Castle - the most famous landmarks in JapanUmeda Sky Building Floating Garden Observatory (main observation deck)Lunch At Local Indian RestaurantDotonbori District - hotspot for tourists","Filled with towering neon signs, clubs, bars & restaurantsClick a picture with the iconic Glico Man, shot from under Ebisubashi bridge, a famous picture pointDinner at local Indian restaurantOvernight Stay in Osaka"]', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590250591827-024505f019f6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80', 9
);
