  139.8, 35.72, 'Culture', 'bg-emerald-500', 
  'Discover Japan''s highlights from traditional landmarks to modern marvels on this 12-day package.', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503899036084-c55cdd92da26?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80', 
