  182, 8, 'Osaka - Kyoto Day Tour ~ Arashiyama, Kinkakuji, Imperial Palace, Fushimi Inari Shrine', 'Kyoto, Kansai', 
  'Pick up from Hotel @0900 HrsArashiyama Bamboo Forest -Japan''s most famous bamboo forest.Walk through the Bamboo groovesKinkaku-ji - Rokuon-ji is a Zen Buddhist temple, the “the Golden Pavilion”, Mirror PondKyoto Imperial Palace - the former palace of the Emperor of Japan (Drive pass/ No stop**)Stop for Lunch (Pay locally)Fushimi Inari Shrine - famous for its thousands of vermilions torii gates (Short stop**)Dinner at Indian restaurantOvernight stay at Hotel in Osaka', '["Pick up from Hotel @0900 HrsArashiyama Bamboo Forest -Japan''s most famous bamboo forest","Walk through the Bamboo groovesKinkaku-ji - Rokuon-ji is a Zen Buddhist temple, the “the Golden Pavilion”, Mirror PondKyoto Imperial Palace - the former palace of the Emperor of Japan (Drive pass/ No stop**)Stop for Lunch (Pay locally)Fushimi Inari Shrine - famous for its thousands of vermilions torii gates (Short stop**)Dinner at Indian restaurantOvernight stay at Hotel in Osaka"]', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590250591827-024505f019f6?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80', 7
);
