  183, 4, 'Osaka/Kyoto - Osaka to Kyoto Transfer/ Kyoto Day Tour ~ Arashiyama, Kinkakuji, Fushimi Inari Shrine', 'Kyoto, Kansai', 
  'After breakfast, check out from Hotel & proceed to KyotoPick up from Hotel @0900 HrsArashiyama Bamboo Forest -Japan''s most famous bamboo forest.Walk through the Bamboo groovesKinkaku-ji - Rokuon-ji is a Zen Buddhist temple, the “the Golden Pavilion”, Mirror PondStop for LunchFushimi Inari Shrine - famous for its thousands of vermilions torii gates (Short stop**)Reach hotel, complete check in formalitiesOvernight stay at Hotel in Kyoto', '["After breakfast, check out from Hotel & proceed to KyotoPick up from Hotel @0900 HrsArashiyama Bamboo Forest -Japan''s most famous bamboo forest","Walk through the Bamboo groovesKinkaku-ji - Rokuon-ji is a Zen Buddhist temple, the “the Golden Pavilion”, Mirror PondStop for LunchFushimi Inari Shrine - famous for its thousands of vermilions torii gates (Short stop**)Reach hotel, complete check in formalitiesOvernight stay at Hotel in Kyoto"]', 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503899036084-c55cdd92da26?auto=format&fit=crop&w=600&q=80', 3
